    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION \nOn the 5th November 2026 at 11am\n\nDNG O'DWYER ARE DELIGHTED TO BRING TO THE MARKET THIS PROMINENT AND DECEPTIVELY SPACIOUS 5 BEDROOM DETACHED RESIDENCE WITHIN WALKING DISTANCE TO CAVAN TOWN CENTRE.\n\nPlease find below link to Online Auction page to register for bidding...\nhttps://odwyer.dngauctions.ie/lot/details/3674ea52-db3f-4d78-adbd-6dea92e8d2c3?returnUrl=%2Fsearch"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.0m x 2.1m\n\n\nSitting Room - 4.6m x 4.2m\n\n\nKitchen/dining room - 4.4m x 3.6m\n\n\nUtility Room - 3.8m x 2.7m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.0m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 3.0m x 1.7m\n\n\nLanding - 3.7m x 1.8m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 2.7m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 2.7m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.7m x 3.5m\n\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.7m x 3.6m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.7m x 1.8m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Introducing an attractive detached house located in the desirable location in the centre of Cavan town.</li><li> This spacious property boasts 5 bedrooms, 1 reception room, and 2 bathrooms, providing ample space for comfortable living.</li><li> The property is a prominent and landmark residence hat is located at the junction of the Cathedral Road (R212) and the Cootehill Road (R188).</li><li> Although residential, with its central location and car parking, the property is also suitable for commercial application.</li><li> With a total area of 143 sq m, this well-maintained home offers a modern and convenient lifestyle for its residents.</li><li> The property features a large outside space, perfect for relaxing or entertaining guests, as well as extensive off-street parking for added convenience.</li><li> Situated in a prime location, this house is easily accessible to local amenities, schools, and transport links, making it an ideal choice for families or professionals looking for a stylish and comfortable place to call home.</li><li> Mains Water Supply</li><li> Mains Sewerage</li><li> Year of Construction : 1963</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Don't miss the opportunity to make this property yours and enjoy the benefits of modern living in a sought-after area.</li><li> Contact us today to arrange a viewing and experience the charm of this exceptional home.</ul>"
      },
